                  *       3.Non-zero page one byte references to zero page.
                  *       4.Zero page one byte references to zero page.
                  *
                  *       Record format
                  *
                  *       |Type   |Length         |Offset1|Offset2|Offsetn|
                  *       |ID     |(RECLEN)       |A Reg. |A Reg. |       |





