                  *               1. Bring closer to Coding Standard (object :
                  *                  R. K. Nordin 11/01/83


      = 5000      STH     =       *       ;entry
5000# 4C0950              JMP     EST     ;execute self-test




                  **      EMS - Execute Memory Self-test
                  *
                  *       ENTRY   JSR     EMS
                  *
