E50E  D005 ^E515          BNE     LHO     ;if handler load desired

                  ;       Indicate nonexistent device error.

                  ;       JMP     IND     ;indicate nonexistent device error,:




                  **      IND - Indicate Nonexistent Device Error
                  *
                  *       ENTRY   JSR     IND
                  *
