                  *               R. S. Scheiman  04/01/82
                  *               1. Bring closer to Coding Standard (object :
                  *                  R. K. Nordin 11/01/83


      = EF26      PTL     =       *       ;entry
EF26  48                  PHA             ;save byte to output
EF27  8A                  TXA             ;IOCB index
